# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the reading-aloud plugin, from FolioSpeech-<ver>.zip.
Package: FolioSpeech
Section: Document
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: Folio
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio
Description: Reading aloud for Folio (British English voice)
 Adds Read aloud and Speak selection to Folio, with a Piper voice
 (Southern English female) and eSpeak NG's English data. It goes into
 Folio's Plugins directory; Folio finds it the next time it starts.
Build-Map: !Folio/Plugins/Speech -> Apps/Document/!Folio/Plugins/Speech
Build-Notice: The speech plugin for Folio, packaged for PackMan from the
 release zip on https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio/releases
 .
 The voice en_GB-southern_english_female-low is a Piper voice under
 CC BY-SA 4.0; the eSpeak NG data is under the GNU GPL version 3.
 Both licences follow.
Build-Copyright: !Folio/Plugins/Speech/VoiceLicence
Build-Copyright: !Folio/Plugins/Speech/eSpeakLicence
